///| Pure-Pion W3C XPath 1.0 query engine (all 13 axes and 27 core functions).
///|
///| Reuses `packages/xml` (`xml::Document`) with a zero-copy read-only `XPathDoc`
///| view, compile-once `XPathExpr::parse` + reusable evaluation, document-order
///| deduplication, external variable & namespace bindings (`XPathContext`), and
///| bounded resource limits (`XPathLimits`). Zero C dependencies, no `World`,
///| Native + Wasm32 dual-target.
